    cheat: ["A timeout creates an unknown outcome for some writes.", "Retry budgets include delay as well as attempts.", "Dispose responses after consumption.", "Connection reuse and DNS refresh need deliberate lifetime choices."],
    pitfalls: ["Retries at several layers multiply downstream traffic.", "Never accept an arbitrary user-supplied URL for a privileged internal client."],
