    summary: "Release producers and consumers independently with compatibility and migration windows.",
    what: "A contract includes meaning, required fields, errors, ordering assumptions, and supported evolution, not only a JSON schema. API clients and event consumers can run older versions long after a producer deploys. A syntactically additive change can still break strict or semantically sensitive consumers.",
