    summary: "Design consumer behavior around delivery guarantees and recoverable poison messages.",
    what: "A broker decouples production from consumption through queues, topics, or logs. Delivery, acknowledgment, ordering, and retention guarantees depend on the broker and configuration. Consumer concurrency can change completion order even when delivery has an ordering property.",
